
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.ListStatistics(Operation: number, ListVariable: {any}): number`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`float llListStatistics(integer Operation, list ListVariable);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a float that is the result of performing statistical aggregate function <b>operation</b> on <b>src</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Operation / operation</td>
          <td>a LIST_STAT_* flag</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>{`{any}`}</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>list</span></td>
          <td>ListVariable / src</td>
          <td>Variable to analyze.</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>list</li>
        <li>math</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">315</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-mandatory">Use Return</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>If a list entry type is not a float or an integer it is silently ignored.</p>
